        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 699BW, Belleview Dummy Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe traditional arched shape of the Belleview Handleset is the perfect finishing touch to enhance the glamour of any classic decor while any of the interior trim selections will look great in almost any home. Made by Kwikset, the 699BW Dummy Door Entrance Set is backed a Kwikset Lifetime finish warranty. It is easy to install and will fit all standard pre-drilled doors. A dummy cylinder, it does not function and is just for looks.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Handleset:</b> is for looks only. It does not lock and do not latch. Dummy handlesets are used as pulls or to match trim on double doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src =\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/Dummy_Cylinder_Handleset.jpg?v=1704352980\" width=\"226\" height=\"180\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Dummy Cylinder Function Chart\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/belleview-single-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-687bw\"><b>Single Cylinder Belleview Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Belleview 699BW Two Piece Dummy Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Crossbore Hole Spacing: 5-1/2\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Sold as a complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Traditional Belleview Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-5/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Crossbore: 2-1/8\" or 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Crossbore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
