                "title": "Belleview Dummy Handleset Kwikset 699BW",
                "description": "The traditional arched shape of the Belleview Handleset is the perfect finishing touch to enhance the glamour of any classic decor while any of the interior trim selections will look great in almost any home. Made by Kwikset, the 699BW Dummy Door Entrance Set is backed a Kwikset Lifetime finish warranty. It is easy to install and will fit all standard pre-drilled doors. A dummy cylinder, it does not function and is just for looks.\r\n",
